{"ticker":"LYV","updated":"2026-10-30T22:57:48Z","profile":{"longName":"Live Nation Entertainment, Inc.","shortName":"Live Nation Entertainment, Inc.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Entertainment","country":"United States","website":"https://www.livenationentertainment.com","fullTimeEmployees":17700,"marketCap":41441165312,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":93.541145,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.5773569,"pegRatio":4.64,"targetMeanPrice":202.625,"targetHighPrice":222.0,"targetLowPrice":145.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.094,"earningsGrowth":1.562,"grossMargins":0.25777,"operatingMargins":0.06696,"profitMargins":0.00513,"totalRevenue":26272534528,"beta":1.171,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":189.25,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":125.34,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Live Nation Entertainment, Inc. operates as a live entertainment company worldwide. The company operates through Concerts, Ticketing, and Sponsorship & Advertising segments. Its Concerts segment promotes live music events in its owned or operated venues, and in rented third-party venues. This segment operates and manages music venues; produces music festivals; creates associated content; and offers management and other services to artists. The Ticketing segment manages the ticketing operations, including the provision of ticketing software and services to consumers with marketplace for tickets and event information through mobile apps, other websites, and retail outlets, as well as its websites, such as livenation.com and ticketmaster.com; and provides ticket resale services. This segment offers ticketing services for arenas, stadiums, amphitheaters, music clubs, concert promoters, professional sports franchises and leagues, college sports teams, performing arts venues, museums, and theaters. Its Sponsorship & Advertising segment sells international, national, and local sponsorships and placement of advertising, including signage, online advertising, and promotional programs; rich media offering, including advertising related with live streaming and music-related content; and ads through distribution network of venues, events, and websites. This segment also manages the develop","summary_zh":"Live Nation Entertainment, Inc. 是一家全球現場娛樂公司。該公司透過音樂會、票務、贊助和廣告部門運營。其音樂會部門在其擁有或經營的場地以及租用的第三方場地推廣現場音樂活動。該部門經營和管理音樂場所；舉辦音樂節；創造相關內容；並為藝術家提供管理和其他服務。票務部門管理票務業務，包括透過行動應用程式、其他網站和零售店及其網站（例如livenation.com和ticketmaster.com）向消費者提供票務軟體和服務，以及門票和活動資訊市場；並提供門票轉售服務。該部門為競技場、體育場、露天劇場、音樂俱樂部、音樂會主辦單位、專業體育特許經營權和聯盟、大學運動隊、表演藝術場館、博物館和劇院提供票務服務。其贊助和廣告部門銷售國際、國內和當地的贊助和廣告投放，包括標牌、線上廣告和促銷計劃；富媒體產品，包括與直播和音樂相關內容相關的廣告；以及透過場館、活動和網站的分銷網路投放廣告。該部門也管理開發","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"娛樂","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":164.3,"h":165.57,"l":163.2,"c":165.47,"v":1461300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":166.44,"h":167.94,"l":160.16,"c":161.97,"v":2671500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":162.73,"h":163.75,"l":161.55,"c":162.98,"v":2449200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":162.98,"h":163.57,"l":162.07,"c":163.42,"v":1244600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":163.94,"h":169.66,"l":163.9,"c":169.4,"v":2341000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":170.86,"h":170.86,"l":168.24,"c":170.3,"v":2150000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":170.84,"h":172.08,"l":169.42,"c":170.9,"v":2025500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":170.89,"h":174.42,"l":170.66,"c":174.06,"v":2456300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":173.75,"h":175.25,"l":172.72,"c":173.73,"v":1408400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":173.79,"h":175.25,"l":171.61,"c":172.38,"v":4176500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":170.07,"h":170.95,"l":166.83,"c":170.42,"v":3120100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":171.0,"h":171.37,"l":167.84,"c":169.37,"v":3168000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":169.85,"h":169.85,"l":163.21,"c":164.68,"v":4224300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":164.65,"h":164.65,"l":161.36,"c":163.72,"v":3822600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":161.83,"h":165.6,"l":161.63,"c":165.15,"v":1962900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":165.37,"h":166.15,"l":163.31,"c":164.13,"v":1407600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":164.46,"h":164.65,"l":161.76,"c":162.08,"v":