count":1},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1335258/000133525826000009/lyv-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We believe that we are the largest live entertainment company in the world, connecting over 805 million fans across all of our concerts and ticketing platforms in 55 countries during 2025.","zh":"我們相信，我們是世界上最大的現場娛樂公司，到 2025 年，我們將在 55 個國家的所有音樂會和票務平台上連接超過 8.05 億粉絲。"},{"en":"We believe we are the largest producer of live music concerts in the world, based on total fans that attend Live Nation events as compared to events of other promoters, connecting 159 million fans to over 11,000 artists at 55,000 events in 2025. Live Nation owns, operates, has exclusive booking rights for or has an equity interest in 460 venues globally, including House of Blues music venues and prestigious locations such as The Fillmore in San Francisco, Brooklyn Bowl in New York City, the Hollywood Palladium in Los Angeles, the Moody Center arena in Austin, the Ziggo Dome in Amsterdam, 3Arena in Dublin, Royal Arena in Copenhagen and Spark Arena in Auckland. We believe we are one of the world's leading artist management companies based on the number of artists represented. Our artist management companies manage music artists and acts across all music genres.","zh":"我們相信，根據參加 Live Nation 活動的粉絲總數（與其他主辦單位的活動相比），我們是全球最大的現場音樂會製作商，到 2025 年，我們將在 55,000 場活動中將 1.59 億粉絲與超過 11,000 名藝術家聯繫起來。 Live Nation 在全球 460 個場館擁有、經營、擁有獨家預訂權或擁有股權，其中包括 House of Blues 音樂場館和舊金山菲爾莫爾 (The Fillmore)、布魯克林碗 (Brooklyn Bowl) 等著名場館紐約市的好萊塢鈀競技場、奧斯汀的穆迪中心競技場、阿姆斯特丹的 Ziggo Dome、都柏林的 3Arena、都柏林的 3Arena、奧克蘭的皇家體育場和奧斯汀的穆迪中心競技場、阿姆斯特丹的 Ziggo Dome、都柏林的 3Arena、都柏林的 3Arena、奧克蘭的皇家體育場和奧斯汀的穆迪中心競技場。我們相信，根據代表的藝術家數量，我們是世界領先的藝術家管理公司之一。我們的藝術家管理公司管理音樂藝術家並在所有音樂流派中表演。"},{"en":"We believe we are the world's leading live entertainment ticketing sales and marketing company, based on the number of tickets we sell. Ticketmaster provides ticket sales services and marketing and distribution globally through www.ticketmaster.com and www.livenation.com and our mobile apps, other websites and numerous retail outlets, distributing 646 million tickets through our systems in 2025. Ticketmaster serves 10,500 clients worldwide across multiple event categories, providing ticketing services for leading arenas, stadiums, festival and concert promoters, professional sports franchises and leagues, college sports teams, performing arts venues, museums and theaters.","zh":"根據我們銷售的門票數量，我們相信我們是世界領先的現場娛樂票務銷售和行銷公司。 Ticketmaster 透過 www.ticketmaster.com 和 www.livenation.com 以及我們的行動應用程式、其他網站和眾多零售店在全球提供門票銷售服務以及行銷和分銷，到 2025 年，將透過我們的系統分發 6.46 億張門票。 Ticketmaster 為全球多個活動類別的 10,500 名客戶提供服務，為領先的競技場、體育場、節日和音樂會主辦方、專業體育特許經營權和聯盟、大學運動隊、表演藝術場館、博物館和劇院提供票務服務。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Sponsorship & Advertising. Our Sponsorship & Advertising segment employs a sales force that creates and maintains relationships with sponsors through a combination of strategic, international, national and local opportunities that allow businesses to reach customers through our concert, festival, venue and ticketing assets, including advertising on our websites. We work with our corporate clients to help create marketing programs that support their business goals and connect their brands directly with fans and artists. We also develop, book and produce custom events or programs for our clients' specific brands, which are typically presented exclusively to the clients' consumers. These custom events can involve live music events with talent and media, using both online and traditional outlets. Including intersegment revenue, our Sponsorship & Advertising business generated $1.3 billion, o","zh":"贊助和廣告。我們的贊助和廣告部門擁有一支銷售隊伍，透過結合策略、國際、國內和本地機會，與贊助商建立並維持關係，使企業能夠透過我們的音樂會、節日、場館和票務資產（包括我們網站上的廣告）接觸客戶。我們與企業客戶合作，協助制定行銷計劃，支持他們的業務目標，並將他們的品牌與粉絲和藝術家直接聯繫起來。我們也為客戶的特定品牌開發、預訂和製作客製化活動或節目，這些活動或節目通常專門呈現給客戶的消費者。這些客製化活動可以包括使用線上和傳統管道的人才和媒體現場音樂活動。包括部門間收入在內，我們的贊助和廣告業務創造了 13 億美元的收入"}],"competition":[{"en":"Competition in the live entertainment industry is intense. We believe that we compete primarily on the basis of our ability to deliver quality music events, sell tickets and provide enhanced fan and artist experiences. We believe that our primary strengths include:","zh":"現場娛樂產業的競爭非常激烈。我們相信，我們的競爭主要取決於我們提供優質音樂活動、銷售門票以及提供增強的粉絲和藝術家體驗的能​​力。我們相信我們的主要優勢包括："},{"en":"our track record and reputation in promoting and producing live music events and tours both domestically and internationally;","zh":"我們在國內外推廣和製作現場音樂活動和巡迴演出方面的記錄和聲譽；"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Concerts","val":20860726000,"zh":"音樂會"},{"name":"Ticketing","val":3081166000,"zh":"售票處"},{"name":"Sponsorship & Advertising","val":1329233000,"zh":"贊助及廣告"}],"total":25201406000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Total Domestic Operations","val":14329362000,"zh":"國內業務總計"},{"name":"Total Foreign Operations","val":10872044000,"zh":"海外業務總計"},{"name":"Europe","val":5815492000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Total Other Foreign Operations","val":5056552000,"zh":"其他海外業務總計"}],"total":25201406000}},"peers":["EXPE","HLT","MTCH","MAR","TPR"]}}